    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "The section has a cohesive dark defense-console aesthetic, strong headline hierarchy, restrained cyan/red/yellow accents, and a polished responsive card. Mobile stacking is especially clear. It falls short of demo-ready polish because the global header is cramped and extremely small on desktop, visibly truncated on tablet, and reduced to an ambiguous icon plus partially exposed horizontal navigation on mobile. Several secondary labels and footer lines are also too tiny and low-contrast, while the desktop composition leaves excessive inert space above the main content.",
